Z||000001||ChadMan||10-24-2000||05:26 PM||||Gary Witzenberg's "Fiero" claims 370,167 (26,401 built in 1988).<P>Mark Corbin's "Fiero Spotter's Guide" claims 370,168 (26,402 built in 1988).||||reg||1
Z||000002||Fformula88||10-24-2000||08:36 PM||||According to the information I received from Pontiac Historical Services (I ordered the package including the original invoice for my car) the built 26,401 in 1988.  Their Total number differ's from both the Spotter's guide and "Fiero" with 370,107.<P>I have the year by year breakdown.<BR>1984  136,842<BR>1985  76,371<BR>1986  83,974<BR>1987  46,529<BR>1988  26,401<BR>TOT   370,107<P>The number of 1988's seems to differ in the GT colum.  Its either 6848 or 6849 depending on what source you look at.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/formula2m6/FIEROSIG1.JPG">  <BR>1988 Fiero Formula||||reg||1
